  1 sharp — earned by: one slip — a single late start, one skipped usual day, one "easy" run at 90% of max HR. A pattern at nagLevel 0.
    sounds like: one dry jab, then you move on
  2 pointed — earned by: a fired pattern at nagLevel 1 — you have raised this once already.
